 "note": "The buildings of the park as it was from 1957 to 1996. Which there were, their number and their type (A4, A6, B4, B6) are those of the earlier of the park's own two maps (raw/park_brochures); their positions those of the topographic maps (raw/topotijdreis) where these have them, RD New (EPSG:28992), metres, good to about 5 m. Made by tools/make_old_park.py. The door, and so the model, follows from the type in data/type_models.json. kind: Bungalow or Chalet. front_azimuth: the way the front door faces, degrees clockwise from north. What is not known is 'Unknown'. source.position: where the position is from; park_maps_off: how far the earlier and the later park map, fitted, have it from there [m]. today: the nearest house of today. later_map_only: what only the later park map shows, the bungalows that came after the old park (type E): not part of the old park, their fitted positions are rough.",
